        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12525205/comment/13117482",
          "id": "13117482",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Nice!  You removed swapSearcher's sync too.  Thanks :)",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2011-09-29T18:03:29.626+0000",
          "updated": "2011-09-29T18:03:29.626+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12525205/comment/13117965",
          "id": "13117965",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "\nOK, mulling on this some more.... I don't think we should go to such\ngreat lengths to remove the sync'd from swapSearcher.\n\nThat sync is harmless in practice (it's uncontended unless the app\nscrews up and calls .close while another thread is calling\n.maybeReopen), and the changes necessary to make it truly lockless\nmakes SearcherManager's code quite a bit more complex.\n\nDon't get me wrong: it's an impressive feat of concurrent programming\nto make swapSearcher lock-free, but just because you can remove a sync\ndoesn't mean you should.\n\nBut we should still fix the original issue, for those apps that do\nmess up: can't we simply move the swapSearcher inside the\ntry/finally/success?\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2011-09-30T10:51:21.433+0000",
          "updated": "2011-09-30T10:51:21.433+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12525205/comment/13118333",
          "id": "13118333",
          "author": {
